{"seq":1,"slug":"model-quantization","title":"模型量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/deployment-and-inference/model-quantization","wordCount":873,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型量化\">模型量化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量化的讨论围绕几个度量与分类展开，后面各节是具体方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量化</strong>：把权重和/或激活值从高精度（FP32/BF16）转为低精度（INT8/INT4）表示，减少模型大小与显存占用。</li>\n<li><strong>位宽与模型大小</strong>：每参数字节数直接决定体积，7B 模型在 BF16 下约 14GB、INT4 下约 3.5GB。</li>\n<li><strong>训练后量化（PTQ）与量化感知训练（QAT）</strong>：PTQ 只需少量校准数据，QAT 在训练中模拟量化、质量更好但成本高。</li>\n<li><strong>粒度与校准</strong>：group_size、是否保护显著通道、校准数据集的选择，决定相同位宽下的质量差异。</li>\n<li><strong>通用性 vs 专用性</strong>：GPTQ/AWQ 面向 GPU 推理，GGUF 面向 CPU 与混合精度，格式与目标硬件绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条主线是**「体积、速度、质量」三者的权衡**：位宽每降一档，体积与显存收益明显，但质量损失逐渐从「可忽略」走向「明显」，方法的价值就在于把这条曲线的损失压到最小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是量化\">什么是量化</h2><p>量化（Quantization）是将模型权重和/或激活值从高精度（如 FP32/BF16）转换为低精度（如 INT8/INT4）表示的技术。它能显著减少模型大小和推理时的显存占用，同时在一定程度上加速推理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    FP32[&quot;FP32&lt;br/&gt;32 bit / 参数&quot;] --&gt; FP16[&quot;FP16 / BF16&lt;br/&gt;16 bit / 参数&quot;]&#10;    FP16 --&gt; INT8[&quot;INT8&lt;br/&gt;8 bit / 参数&quot;]&#10;    INT8 --&gt; INT4[&quot;INT4&lt;br/&gt;4 bit / 参数&quot;]&#10;    INT4 --&gt; INT2[&quot;INT2&lt;br/&gt;2 bit / 参数&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    FP32[\"FP32&lt;br/&gt;32 bit / 参数\"] --&gt; FP16[\"FP16 / BF16&lt;br/&gt;16 bit / 参数\"]\n    FP16 --&gt; INT8[\"INT8&lt;br/&gt;8 bit / 参数\"]\n    INT8 --&gt; INT4[\"INT4&lt;br/&gt;4 bit / 参数\"]\n    INT4 --&gt; INT2[\"INT2&lt;br/&gt;2 bit / 参数\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>每参数字节</th>\n<th>7B 模型大小</th>\n<th>质量损失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP32</td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>28 GB</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BF16</td>\n<td>2 bytes</td>\n<td>14 GB</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>1 byte</td>\n<td>7 GB</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4</td>\n<td>0.5 bytes</td>\n<td>3.5 GB</td>\n<td>小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT2</td>\n<td>0.25 bytes</td>\n<td>1.75 GB</td>\n<td>明显</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gptq\">GPTQ</h2><p>GPTQ 是一种基于二阶信息的训练后量化方法（Post-Training Quantization），逐层对权重进行量化，使用 Hessian 矩阵信息来最小化量化误差：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, GPTQConfig&#10;&#10;gptq_config = {&#10;    &quot;bits&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;group_size&quot;: 128,&#10;    &quot;desc_act&quot;: True,&#10;    &quot;dataset&quot;: &quot;c4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;damp_percent&quot;: 0.1,&#10;}&#10;&#10;# config = GPTQConfig(&#10;#     bits=4,&#10;#     dataset=&quot;c4&quot;,&#10;#     group_size=128,&#10;# )&#10;# model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;#     &quot;meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B&quot;,&#10;#     quantization_config=config,&#10;#     device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;# )&#10;&#10;print(&quot;GPTQ 量化配置:&quot;)&#10;for k, v in gptq_config.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {k}: {v}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, GPTQConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gptq_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"group_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"desc_act\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"dataset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"damp_percent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># config = GPTQConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     bits=4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     dataset=\"c4\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     group_size=128,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     quantization_config=config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     device_map=\"auto\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GPTQ 量化配置:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gptq_config.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    M[&quot;原始模型 (FP16)&quot;] --&gt; Cal[&quot;校准数据&lt;br/&gt;(128-256 条)&quot;]&#10;    Cal --&gt; Layer[&quot;逐层量化&quot;]&#10;    Layer --&gt; Hessian[&quot;Hessian 误差修正&quot;]&#10;    Hessian --&gt; QM[&quot;量化模型 (INT4)&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    M[\"原始模型 (FP16)\"] --&gt; Cal[\"校准数据&lt;br/&gt;(128-256 条)\"]\n    Cal --&gt; Layer[\"逐层量化\"]\n    Layer --&gt; Hessian[\"Hessian 误差修正\"]\n    Hessian --&gt; QM[\"量化模型 (INT4)\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"awq\">AWQ</h2><p>AWQ（Activation-aware Weight Quantization）基于一个关键观察：并非所有权重同等重要。保护那些对应于大激活值的&quot;显著&quot;权重通道，可以显著降低量化损失：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"awq_config = {&#10;    &quot;bits&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;group_size&quot;: 128,&#10;    &quot;zero_point&quot;: True,&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;GEMM&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;# from awq import AutoAWQForCausalLM&#10;# model = AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&quot;meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B&quot;)&#10;# model.quantize(&#10;#     tokenizer,&#10;#     quant_config={&quot;w_bit&quot;: 4, &quot;q_group_size&quot;: 128, &quot;zero_point&quot;: True}&#10;# )&#10;&#10;print(&quot;AWQ: 保护显著权重通道，降低量化损失&quot;)&#10;for k, v in awq_config.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {k}: {v}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">awq_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"group_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"zero_point\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GEMM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from awq import AutoAWQForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># model = AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># model.quantize(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     tokenizer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     quant_config={\"w_bit\": 4, \"q_group_size\": 128, \"zero_point\": True}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AWQ: 保护显著权重通道，降低量化损失\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awq_config.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>GPTQ</th>\n<th>AWQ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量化原理</td>\n<td>Hessian 误差修正</td>\n<td>激活感知权重保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准需求</td>\n<td>需要校准数据</td>\n<td>需要校准数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化速度</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>略快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容框架</td>\n<td>exllama, vLLM</td>\n<td>vLLM, TGI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gguf-格式\">GGUF 格式</h2><p>GGUF（GPT-Generated Unified Format）是 llama.cpp 使用的量化格式，专为 CPU 推理优化。它支持混合精度量化——不同层使用不同的位宽：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"gguf_quant_types = {&#10;    &quot;Q2_K&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 2.5, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★☆☆☆&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;2.8 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;Q3_K_M&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 3.3, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★☆☆&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;3.5 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;Q4_K_M&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 4.8, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★★☆&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;4.4 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;Q5_K_M&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 5.7, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★★☆&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;5.1 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;Q6_K&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 6.6, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★★★&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;5.9 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;Q8_0&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 8.5, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★★★&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;7.7 GB&quot;},&#10;    &quot;F16&quot;: {&quot;bits&quot;: 16.0, &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;★★★★★&quot;, &quot;size_7b&quot;: &quot;14.0 GB&quot;},&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;{&#39;量化类型&#39;:&lt;12} {&#39;位宽&#39;:&gt;6} {&#39;7B 大小&#39;:&gt;10} {&#39;质量&#39;:&gt;8}&quot;)&#10;print(&quot;-&quot; * 40)&#10;for name, info in gguf_quant_types.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;{name:&lt;12} {info[&#39;bits&#39;]:&gt;5.1f}b {info[&#39;size_7b&#39;]:&gt;10} {info[&#39;quality&#39;]:&gt;8}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gguf_quant_types </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q2_K\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★☆☆☆\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.8 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q3_K_M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★☆☆\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.5 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q4_K_M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★★☆\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4.4 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q5_K_M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★★☆\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"5.1 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q6_K\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★★★\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"5.9 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Q8_0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★★★\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7.7 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"F16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"★★★★★\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size_7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"14.0 GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'量化类型'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:&#x3C;12</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'位宽'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>6</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7B 大小'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>10</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'质量'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>8</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gguf_quant_types.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:&#x3C;12</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bits'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>5.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">b </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'size_7b'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>10</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>8</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于消费级硬件，Q4_K_M 是推荐的默认选择——在文件大小和输出质量之间取得了最佳平衡。Q5_K_M 和 Q6_K 在质量上进一步提升，但需要更多内存。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"量化感知训练\">量化感知训练</h2><p>量化感知训练（Quantization-Aware Training, QAT）在训练过程中模拟量化效果，使模型学会适应低精度表示：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 训练后量化 PTQ&#10;        M1[&quot;训练 (FP16)&quot;] --&gt; Q1[&quot;量化 (INT4)&quot;]&#10;        Q1 --&gt; I1[&quot;推理&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 量化感知训练 QAT&#10;        M2[&quot;训练 (FP16)&lt;br/&gt;+ 模拟量化&quot;] --&gt; Q2[&quot;量化 (INT4)&quot;]&#10;        Q2 --&gt; I2[&quot;推理&lt;br/&gt;(质量更好)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 训练后量化 PTQ\n        M1[\"训练 (FP16)\"] --&gt; Q1[\"量化 (INT4)\"]\n        Q1 --&gt; I1[\"推理\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 量化感知训练 QAT\n        M2[\"训练 (FP16)&lt;br/&gt;+ 模拟量化\"] --&gt; Q2[\"量化 (INT4)\"]\n        Q2 --&gt; I2[\"推理&lt;br/&gt;(质量更好)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>量化质量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PTQ (GPTQ/AWQ)</td>\n<td>低（仅需校准）</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>通用量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QAT</td>\n<td>高（需要训练）</td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>极低位宽(2-3 bit)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QLoRA</td>\n<td>中（微调）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>微调 + 量化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量化将模型从高精度转为低精度，显著减少显存占用和模型大小。</li>\n<li>GPTQ 使用 Hessian 信息逐层量化，AWQ 保护显著权重通道，两者都是优秀的 4-bit 方案。</li>\n<li>GGUF 格式专为 CPU 推理设计，支持灵活的混合精度量化。</li>\n<li>Q4_K_M 是消费级硬件上的推荐默认量化方案。</li>\n<li>量化感知训练在训练时模拟量化效果，适合对质量要求极高的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型量化","id":"模型量化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是量化","id":"什么是量化"},{"level":2,"text":"GPTQ","id":"gptq"},{"level":2,"text":"AWQ","id":"awq"},{"level":2,"text":"GGUF 格式","id":"gguf-格式"},{"level":2,"text":"量化感知训练","id":"量化感知训练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结构化输出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/prompt-engineering/structured-output"},"next":{"title":"推理优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/deployment-and-inference/inference-optimization"}}